{"unit_id":"ManoloRemiddi__DSH-Metafolder-Plugin#card-zh","repo":"ManoloRemiddi/DSH-Metafolder-Plugin","commit":"a5332d902e147e824231a5470d3e2822b9288719","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Metafolder Plugin 是 DSH 网页端侧边栏插件：为工作区和会话添加可折叠的视觉分组。它接管 sidebar.workspaces 区域，在现有工作区列表上呈现分组与会话。用户可以创建、重命名、删除和排序分组，通过拖放或行菜单归类工作区与会话，搜索会话并在指定分组中新建工作区。分组支持颜色、折叠状态和工作区/平铺视图。适合希望整理侧边栏项目和会话的 DSH 网页用户；元数据保存在浏览器本地，无需额外密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:583-621","client.js:647-667","client.js:947-953","client.js:1062-1072","client.js:1157-1168"]}
{"unit_id":"ManoloRemiddi__DSH-Metafolder-Plugin#card-en","repo":"ManoloRemiddi/DSH-Metafolder-Plugin","commit":"a5332d902e147e824231a5470d3e2822b9288719","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Metafolder Plugin adds collapsible workspace and session groups to the DSH web sidebar. It replaces the sidebar.workspaces view and supports colored groups, drag-and-drop filing, session search, and creating workspaces inside groups. Metadata stays in browser storage; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:583-621","client.js:647-667","client.js:947-953","client.js:1062-1072","client.js:1157-1168"]}
